[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3979563228","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116615#issuecomment-3979563228","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116615","id":3979563228,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7tM1Dc","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-01T09:22:45Z","updated_at":"2026-03-01T09:22:45Z","body":"I did a quick test and it doesn't seem to be a serious issue because signals are still working as expected. I've moved this to `up for grabs` since I won't have time to tackle it at the moment. If anyone wants to take a look in the meantime, feel free.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3979563228/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4001285961","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116615#issuecomment-4001285961","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116615","id":4001285961,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ufsdJ","user":{"login":"zuedev","id":24614929,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NjE0OTI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24614929?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zuedev","html_url":"https://github.com/zuedev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zuedev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zuedev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zuedev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zuedev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zuedev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zuedev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zuedev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zuedev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zuedev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-05T00:57:56Z","updated_at":"2026-03-05T00:57:56Z","body":"This happens because `ADD_SIGNAL` registers signals at the class level in `ClassDB`, shared across all `JNISingleton` instances. The second plugin's registration triggers `ERR_FAIL_COND_MSG` even though signals still work correctly at the instance level.\n\nI think a guard-and-warn pattern is a reasonable and non-invasive fix for this issue. I've submitted a PR to soften the error to a warning here: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117079\n\nAlternative approaches are:\n\n- Give each plugin its own registered class\n- Register signals per-instance instead of per-class\n- Use a flag/variant of `ClassDB::add_signal` that allows duplicates","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4001285961/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4151449800","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116615#issuecomment-4151449800","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116615","id":4151449800,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc73chjI","user":{"login":"humayune01","id":162161731,"node_id":"U_kgDOCapkQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162161731?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/humayune01","html_url":"https://github.com/humayune01","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/humayune01/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/humayune01/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/humayune01/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/humayune01/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/humayune01/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/humayune01/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/humayune01/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/humayune01/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/humayune01/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-30T00:31:07Z","updated_at":"2026-03-30T00:31:07Z","body":"I get this issue on some android devices and app crashes:\n\n[split_config.arm64_v8a.apk!libc++_shared.so] std::__ndk1::recursive_mutex::lock()\n\nit started since I added notification scheduler plugin in my app.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4151449800/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":n